      "text": "// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n//  The socket thread. Everything below runs here and nowhere else.\n// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nvoid WebBridgeServer::Impl::ThreadEntry(void* self)\n{\n    static_cast<WebBridgeServer::Impl*>(self)->ThreadMain();\n}\n\n",
      "sha256": "9fcce9128104e8997c2979df6810e7eddafa1cf87beca4a3bc3b09e946399a9d",
      "function_body_sha256": "7899e68900a4ca9bf4d707be2a5ab949fc80a4b5f2d1967a5b00079aaa4b9c3e",
